{"pm_knowledge", "event_log", "all", "", "\n\n"},
{"pm_knowledge", "event_log", "all", "traditional", "\nIf you need it, the process variant for a case can be obtained as concatenation of the activities of a case.\nIf you need it, the duration of a case can be obtained as difference between the timestamp of the first and the last event.\n    "},
{"pm_knowledge", "event_log", "all", "ocel20", "\nIf you need to compute the duration of a lifecycle of an object, compute the difference between the timestamp of the last and the first event of the lifecycle.\nIf you need to compute the variant for an object, aggregate the names of the activities.\n    "},
